  "description": "The Orleans.Lattice Explorer AppKit: the static assets that run inside a Lattice App's sandboxed frame - the app-agnostic bootstrap document, its loader, the in-frame lattice API, the kit stylesheet and fonts, and the frame protocol schema - plus AppKitProtocol, the protocol's .NET constants for a host that speaks it. It has no project dependencies; the Explorer serves its assets under appkit/v1/ from _content/Orleans.Lattice.Explorer.AppKit.",
